ber-200 transition hover:bg-amber-300/10\" href=\"/support\">Support Us</a><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap rounded-full bg-blue-600 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-lg shadow-blue-950/30 transition hover:bg-blue-500\" href=\"/request-tool\">Request New Tool</a></div><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Toggle navigation menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"inline-flex h-11 w-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-slate-900 text-white xl:hidden\"><span class=\"flex w-5 flex-col gap-1.5\"><span class=\"h-0.5 rounded-full bg-current\"></span><span class=\"h-0.5 rounded-full bg-current\"></span><span class=\"h-0.5 rounded-full bg-current\"></span></span></button></div></nav><script type=\"application/ld+json\">[{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"CollectionPage\",\"name\":\"Free Online Audio Tools\",\"description\":\"Inspect, trim, convert and adjust audio files with browser-based tools.\",\"url\":\"https://a2zconvertor.co.uk/audio-tools\"},{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Which audio formats are supported?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Tools accept combinations of MP3, WAV, OGG and M4A depending on browser decoding support.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Why is the download sometimes WAV?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"WAV is the reliable client-side export format used when MP3 encoding would require a heavier dependency.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does audio leave my device?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Audio decoding and processing run in your browser.\"}}]},{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://a2zconvertor.co.uk\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Audio Tools\",\"item\":\"https://a2zconvertor.co.uk/audio-tools\"}]}]</script><section class=\"px-6 pb-16 pt-20\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl\"><p class=\"mb-3 text-sm font-semibold uppercase text-blue-300\">4<!-- --> browser-based tools</p><h1 class=\"max-w-4xl text-5xl font-black tracking-tight md:text-6xl\">Free Online Audio Tools</h1><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-300\">Work with common audio files using Web Audio API tools for metadata, trimming, volume adjustment and WAV conversion.</p></div></section><section class=\"px-6 pb-20\"><div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><a class=\"group flex min-h-56 flex-col rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-6 transition hover:border-blue-500/60 hover:bg-slate-900\" href=\"/convert/audio-metadata\"><p class=\"mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-blue-300\">Audio Tools</p><h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold\">Audio Metadata Viewer</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-slate-400\">View MP3, WAV, OGG and M4A metadata including duration and file size.</p><span class=\"mt-auto pt-5 text-sm font-semibold text-blue-300\">Open tool</span></a><a class=\"group flex min-h-56 flex-col rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-6 transition hover:border-blue-500/60 hover:bg-slate-900\" href=\"/convert/mp3-cutter\"><p class=\"mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-blue-300\">Audio Tools</p><h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold\">MP3 Cutter</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-slate-400\">Trim MP3 audio by start and end time in your browser and export WAV.</p><span class=\"mt-auto pt-5 text-sm font-semibold text-blue-300\">Open tool</span></a><a class=\"group flex min-h-56 flex-col rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-6 transition hover:border-blue-500/60 hover:bg-slate-900\" href=\"/convert/change-audio-volume\"><p class=\"mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-blue-300\">Audio Tools</p><h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold\">Change Audio Volume</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-slate-400\">Adjust MP3, WAV, OGG or M4A volume in your browser and export WAV audio.</p><span class=\"mt-auto pt-5 text-sm font-semibold text-blue-300\">Open tool</span></a><a class=\"group flex min-h-56 flex-col rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-6 transition hover:border-blue-500/60 hover:bg-slate-900\" href=\"/convert/audio-converter\"><p class=\"mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-blue-300\">Audio Tools</p><h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold\">Convert Audio to WAV</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-slate-400\">Convert MP3, WAV, OGG or M4A audio to WAV in your browser.</p><span class=\"mt-auto pt-5 text-sm font-semibold text-blue-300\">Open tool</span></a></div></section><section class=\"px-6 pb-20\"><div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-5 lg:grid-cols-2\"><aside class=\"rounded-2xl border border-amber-300/25 bg-amber-300/5 p-6\"><span class=\"inline-flex rounded-full border px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wide border-amber-300/40 bg-amber-300/10 text-amber-200 \">RECOMMENDED PARTNER</span><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-2xl font-black text-white\">Wondershare UniConverter</h3><p class=\"mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-300\">Use A2ZConvertor for quick online conversions. For desktop batch conversion and larger video/audio workflows, UniConverter may be useful.</p><p class=\"mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-400\">Need desktop video, audio or batch file conversion? UniConverter is useful when browser-based tools are not enough.</p><div class=\"mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><a href=\"https://www.anrdoezrs.net/click-101806287-14091623\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"sponsored nofollow noopener noreferrer\" class=\"rounded-xl bg-amber-300 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-slate-950 hover:bg-amber-200\">Try UniConverter</a></div><p class=\"mt-4 text-xs leading-5 text-slate-500\">Affiliate disclosure: this page may contain affiliate links. If you buy through these links, A2ZConvertor may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.</p></aside></div></section><section class=\"border-y border-white/10 bg-slate-900/40 px-6 py-16\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-4xl\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-black\">Why use these tools?</h2><div class=\"mt-6 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2\"><p class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-950/60 p-6 leading-7 text-slate-300\">Make quick audio changes without a full desktop audio editor.</p><p class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-950/60 p-6 leading-7 text-slate-300\">Receive clearly labelled WAV output when browser-native MP3 encoding is not dependable.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"px-6 py-20\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-4xl\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-black\">Frequently asked questions</h2><div class=\"mt-8 space-y-4\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-bold\">Which audio formats are supported?</h3><p class=\"mt-2 leading-7 text-slate-400\">Tools accept combinations of MP3, WAV, OGG and M4A depending on browser decoding support.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-bold\">Why is the download sometimes WAV?</h3><p class=\"mt-2 leading-7 text-slate-400\">WAV is the reliable client-side export format used when MP3 encoding would require a heavier dependency.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-bold\">Does audio leave my device?</h3><p class=\"mt-2 leading-7 text-slate-400\">Audio decoding and processing run in your browser.</p></div></div><h2 class=\"mt-16 text-2xl font-black\">Explore other categories</h2><div class=\"mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><a class=\"rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-200 hover:border-blue-500/60\" href=\"/image-tools\">Image Tools</a><a class=\"rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-200 hover:border-blue-500/60\" href=\"/pdf-tools\">PDF Tools</a><a class=\"rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold 